#: ca0d521a0d324c02913ec1194d136f44
msgid ""
"Built on top of the SwarmLink hardware, `EasySwarm "
"<https://guide.robsense.com/chapter3-1/communication/easyswarm.html>`__ is a"
" developer focused ground station and development kit aimed at making "
"swarming easier.  This free and open source software can be found in the "
"`RobSense SwarmLink github repo "
"<https://github.com/RobSenseTech/SwarmLink>`__."
msgstr ""
"基于 SwarmLink 硬件构建，`EasySwarm "
"<https://guide.robsense.com/chapter3-1/communication/easyswarm.html>`__ "
"是一款面向开发者的地面站和开发套件，旨在简化集群飞行操作。此免费开源软件可在 `RobSense SwarmLink GitHub 仓库 "
"<https://github.com/RobSenseTech/SwarmLink>`__ 找到。"

